                                    <watches>5</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14248694" author="ikelly" created="Tue, 16 Dec 2014 19:01:36 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The attached patch includes a scripts which does the following.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. Download the current master docs directory from subversion&lt;br/&gt;
2. Download the master branch from git&lt;br/&gt;
3. Build the javadoc&lt;br/&gt;
4. Sync master docs from the site with that from git&lt;br/&gt;
5. Sync the javadoc&lt;br/&gt;
6. Commit the changes to the site if anything has changed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14248812" author="hadoopqa" created="Tue, 16 Dec 2014 20:02:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Testing JIRA &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-828&quot; title=&quot;Script for updating docs on website from master branch&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;BOOKKEEPER-828&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;BOOKKEEPER-828&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Patch &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12687540/0001-Script-to-update-master-documentation.patch&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;0001-Script-to-update-master-documentation.patch&lt;/a&gt; downloaded at Tue Dec 16 19:23:58 UTC 2014&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;----------------------------&lt;/p&gt;

